      "Townhouse Site - house on about 0.5 Ac",
      "",
      "The purchaser submitted a planning application to rezone lands at 2072- 2102 Ghent Avenue to permit a 58-unit townhouse development. The application proposes 2-storey townhouses around the perimeter of the site (30 units) and 3-storey back-to-back townhouses in the centre of the site (28 units).",
      "",
      "The eight properties under application have an area of 1.19 hectares (2.9 acres) and are designated Residential-Medium Density in the Burlington Official Plan. This designation permits either ground or non-ground-oriented housing units with a density ranging between 26 and 50 units per net hectare. The properties are currently zoned RM1, H-RM1 and RM4. These zones do not permit townhouses so the applicant is requesting rezoning to a medium density zone to permit the proposed development."
